Subject: [PATCH] feat: live /pricing page + align site pricing to 5 tiers

- New /pricing page: brand-styled 5-tier ladder (Free, Individual $15,
  Individual Plus $29, Event $200, Org $3,500), wired to checkout.
  $15/$29 -> Stripe subscription; Event -> create-event; Org -> org checkout.
  Logged-out visitors are routed to signup and returned to their tier.
- Add Pricing to nav + footer on landing, guide, how-it-works.
- Landing CTA now mentions the personal plans and links /pricing.
- Guide pricing table gains Individual $15 and Individual Plus $29 so the
  site matches the pricing menu (previously omitted the personal subs).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
